    "short_description": "A hand-drawn story exploration game set 300 years after the apocalypse. You play an archaeologist named Professor Zay, joined by her companion, ARORA, a centuries-old AI capable of recreating human memories from scanned relics.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Spain",
